[7297]="7000E374\n1\tTalk to Saija\tSpeak to Saija inside of Halla-kolo.\n2\tSearch for Narchuil\tSearch Halla-kolo for the ring Narchuil. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSearch for Narchuil\tSearch Halla-kolo for the ring Narchuil.\n",
[7298]="700443DC\n1\tGreet Bingo's neighbours outside his hobbit-hole\tMyrtle Boggs leads a small group of Bingo's neighbours on the path outside his hobbit-hole.\n2\tTalk to Myrtle on the path outside Bingo's hobbit-hole\tMyrtle Boggs is outside Bingo's hobbit-hole. Is she coming to the party?\n3\tGreet the guests for Bingo's party as they arrive\tMore guests are arriving for Bingo's party, and you should greet them and make them feel welcome.\n4\tMore guests are arriving to Bingo's party every moment, but there is no guarantee they will all get along!\t\n5\tGreet the new arrivals\tMore guests are arriving for Bingo's party!\n6\tTalk to Bert Bartleby outside Bingo's hobbit-hole\tBert Bartleby has arrived outside Bingo's hobbit-hole, and he is ready to commence with the feasting!\n7\tEnter Bingo's home for the party\tThe party is in full swing!\n8\tTalk to Bingo Boffin\030Talk to Marigold Boffin\030Talk to Spalvi Stout-heart\030Talk to Violed Isbrun\030Talk to Iola Isbrun\030Talk to Merrimac Fairbairn\030Talk to Dinodas Boffin\030Talk to Celandine Brandybuck\030Talk to Griffo Boffin\030Talk to Milo Goodbody\030Talk to Theodore Gorse\030Talk to Bert Bartleby\030Talk to Ketill Map-maker\030Talk to Haley Meadowsweet\030Talk to Prisca Boffin\030Talk to Donnamira Took\030Talk to Maervadhor\tBingo's home is packed with many of the friends he made on his journey, and you should mingle with the guests before the bell is rung for dinner.\n9\tTalk to Bingo in his home\tBingo is near the kitchen of his hobbit-hole. Now that you have done some mingling, you should see how your host is enjoying his party.\n",
[7299]="700582D0\n1\tApproach the vision of Fram\tApproach the vision of Fram.\n2\tExperience the vision\tExperience the vision.\n",
[7300]="700539F2\n1\tTalk to Gandalf\tGandalf speaks to you of the discoveries he made while studying the Black Book.\n2\tMove through the twisting passage until you reach the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory\tVóin writes of his adventures in the Grey Mountains, where he encountered Magoldir the Elf and the two became fast friends.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf in the Grey Mountains, as depicted by the Halls of Memory\tGandalf is in the Grey Mountains as they are depicted by the Halls of Memory.\n4\tListen to the words of Gandalf concerning his discoveries\tGandalf is in the Grey Mountains as they are depicted by the Halls of Memory.\n5\tExamine the indistinct figures\tTwo thousand years following his survival of the Siege of Barad-dûr, Magoldir adventured in the Grey Mountains... but he did not travel alone.\n6\tListen to the words of Gandalf concerning his discoveries\tTwo thousand years following his survival of the Siege of Barad-dûr, Magoldir adventured in the Grey Mountains... but he did not travel alone.\n7\tExamine the indistinct figure that remains\tTwo thousand years following his survival of the Siege of Barad-dûr, Magoldir adventured in the Grey Mountains... but he did not travel alone.\n8\tListen to the words of Gandalf concerning his discoveries\tGandalf is in the Grey Mountains as they are depicted by the Halls of Memory.\n",
[7301]="7004A1D5\n1\tEnter the combat area\tEnter the combat area.\n2\tHear Gumog's words\tHear Gumog's words.\n3\tEnter the combat area\tEnter the combat area.\n4\tDefeat the first opponent\tDefeat the first opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tDefeat the second opponent\tDefeat the second opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tDefeat the third opponent\tDefeat the third opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tTalk to Párgrub\tTalk to Párgrub.\n",
[7302]="7004A1CB\n1\tEnter the combat area\tEnter the combat area.\n2\tDefeat the first opponent\tDefeat the first opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefeat the second opponent\tDefeat the second opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tDefeat the third opponent\tDefeat the third opponent. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tHear Gumog's words\tHear Gumog's words.\n6\tEnter the combat area\tEnter the combat area.\n7\tDefeat the previous tournament's victor\tDefeat the previous tournament's victor.\n8\tFend off the hordes of Orcs!\tFight off the hoards of Orcs!\n9\tTalk to Párgrub\tTalk to Párgrub.\n",
